    "question_en": "Arrange the following judicial decisions regarding Parliament power to amend Fundamental Rights under Article 368 in correct chronological order:\n\n1. Shankari Prasad v. Union of India (Upheld 1st CAA & Parliament power to amend Part III including FRs)\n2. Sajjan Singh v. State of Rajasthan (Upheld 17th CAA & reaffirmed Parliament power to amend FRs)\n3. Golaknath v. State of Punjab (Overruled Shankari Prasad & Sajjan Singh; declared FRs unamendable)\n4. Kesavananda Bharati v. State of Kerala (Overruled Golaknath; held FRs amendable subject to Basic Structure)",
