    "question_en": "Arrange the following events regarding the Ninth Schedule and its immunity from Fundamental Rights judicial review in correct chronological order:\n\n1. Creation of Ninth Schedule and Article 31B by 1st Constitutional Amendment Act\n2. Kesavananda Bharati Judgment cutoff date for Ninth Schedule protection (April 24, 1973)\n3. Waman Rao v. Union of India Judgment (Reaffirmed April 24, 1973 as cutoff date for Ninth Schedule review)\n4. I.R. Coelho v. State of Tamil Nadu Judgment (Ruled Ninth Schedule laws inserted post-April 24, 1973 are subject to Judicial Review)",
